{
  "profileVersion": 1,
  "id": "vxe-mad-r-major",
  "_documentation": {
    "about": "VXE MAD R / MAD R Major 固有のデバイス定義。プロトコルは Compx/Scyrox 系と同じ 16バイト・レポートID 8・チェックサム (0x55-総和-8) だが、設定はフラッシュ直読みではなくページ方式（アドレス=ページID）で、DPIはX/Y独立エンコード。",
    "protocolSource": "https://github.com/dkbednarczyk/madr (madr-lib, Apache-2.0) — 全モジュールの実装をプロトコル参照として使用",
    "additionalReferences": [
      "https://bednarczyk.xyz/blog/reverse-engineering-a-gaming-mouse/ (作者のリバースエンジニアリング記事)"
    ],
    "differences": [
      "ページ方式: 0x00=性能(6B), 0xA9=デバウンサ+スリープ(10B), 0xB5=センサーモード(6B), 0x0C+8n=DPIペア(8B), 0x2C+8n=RGBペア(8B)",
      "DPIレコードはX/Y独立 [xLow, yLow, hi, ck]、レンジ100-30000 (50刻み)",
      "ハンドシェーク/オンライン照会コマンドなし — バッテリー照会で生存確認",
      "スリープ変更は0xA9ページ書き込み後、0xB5確認ブロック書き込みが必要"
    ],
    "verifiedOn": "VXE MAD R Major 8Kドングル (0x373b:0x1040), 2026-11-18 — バッテリー45%/3842mV、2000Hz、DPI 400/800/1600/3200、デバウンサ4ms、スリープ60s、部分書き込みの他バイト保持を確認"
  },
  "meta": {
    "name": "VXE MAD R Major",
    "brand": "VXE (ATK)",
    "models": [
      "MAD R Major",
      "MAD R"
    ],
    "connectionLabel": "ワイヤレス (ドングル)",
    "notes": "VID 0x373B。パケット形式・チェックサムはScyrox系と同一、メモリマップはページ方式。"
  },
  "usb": {
    "vendorId": "0x373b",
    "productIds": [
      "0x103f",
      "0x1040"
    ],
    "pidLabels": {
      "0x103f": "有線接続",
      "0x1040": "8Kドングル"
    },
    "vendorUsagePageMin": "0xff00",
    "probeCommand": "battery"
  },
  "transport": {
    "reportId": 8,
    "packetLength": 16,
    "layout": {
      "command": 0,
      "status": 1,
      "addressHi": 2,
      "addressLo": 3,
      "length": 4,
      "data": 5,
      "dataMax": 10,
      "checksum": 15
    },
    "checksum": {
      "algorithm": "subtract-from-sum",
      "base": "0x55",
      "subtractReportId": true
    },
    "singleByteWrite": {
      "dataLength": 2,
      "complementBase": "0x55"
    },
    "configImage": {
      "mode": "pages",
      "length": 256,
      "pages": [
        {
          "address": "0x00",
          "len": 6,
          "_": "性能: [rate, comp, 03, 52, stage-1, comp]"
        },
        {
          "address": "0xa9",
          "len": 10,
          "_": "[debounce, comp, 01, 54, sleep×10s, comp, 00, 55, 01, 54]"
        },
        {
          "address": "0xb5",
          "len": 6,
          "_": "[00, 55, 06, 4f, sensorMode, comp]"
        },
        {
          "address": "0x0c",
          "len": 8
        },
        {
          "address": "0x14",
          "len": 8
        },
        {
          "address": "0x1c",
          "len": 8
        },
        {
          "address": "0x24",
          "len": 8
        },
        {
          "address": "0x2c",
          "len": 8
        },
        {
          "address": "0x34",
          "len": 8
        },
        {
          "address": "0x3c",
          "len": 8
        },
        {
          "address": "0x44",
          "len": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    "statusSyncBeforeWrite": null,
    "_comment": "書き込み前のステータス同期は本機では不要（madr-libも同期なしで書き込む）。"
  },
  "commands": {
    "battery": {
      "id": "0x04",
      "response": {
        "level": 5,
        "charging": 6,
        "voltageHi": 7,
        "voltageLo": 8
      }
    },
    "readFlash": {
      "id": "0x08",
      "responseMatch": "extended"
    },
    "writeFlash": {
      "id": "0x07"
    }
  },
  "versionFormat": "v{major}.{minorHex2}",
  "statusFlags": {},
  "ui": {
    "deviceInfo": [
      {
        "key": "product",
        "label": "製品"
      },
      {
        "key": "connection",
        "label": "接続方式"
      },
      {
        "key": "voltage",
        "label": "電池電圧"
      }
